#: ../../integration_guides/ITSM/ServiceNow.rst:57
msgid ""
"|morpheus| supports integration with single-domain and multi-domain "
"ServiceNow appliances. In multi-domain installations, a selected "
"ServiceNow company can be mapped to a selected |morpheus| Tenant for "
"purposes of exposing |morpheus| Library items only to users within a "
"certain company. In this configuration, ServiceNow integrations should be"
" added in each relevant |morpheus| Tenant. Further setup steps for "
"exposing |morpheus| library items to ServiceNow are included in a later "
"section below."
